WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.034
Reasoned judgments about a text need evidence, not guesses. Compare related claims

00:00:05.034 --> 00:00:07.048
and decide what each supports.

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:14.081
“Ama sorted paper and plastic into separate bins.” What is the main idea? Answer: Ama

00:00:14.081 --> 00:00:15.739
separated waste for recycling.

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:21.539
Read two short paragraphs and identify one point of agreement and one difference

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:22.675
using text evidence.

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:26.392
Why it works: The central action is sorting waste.
